      "body": "Hi,\r\nthank you for your reply!\r\n\r\nCan I ask you another thing?\r\nEvery time I send the form I always get \"Please enter a complete address\"\r\nI put this field as not required.\r\nI filled every part... but it doesn't work if I set a country different to USA.\r\n\r\nI probably found the cause:\r\nIt always tries to check that the \"state\" field is not empty, but it is only active when USA is selected.\r\nIs there a way to solve that behavior?\r\n\r\nThank you for all!",
