      "body": "Hi @Filoz,\r\n\r\nMailChimp has a lot of issues with international addresses but I believe if you set the address field to not required both in MailChimp.com and in the plugin it should work. \r\n\r\nYour work around is also acceptable but this functionality should be available without any additional code.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want to try that.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nKevin.",
