      "created_at": "2017-12-12T13:21:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-12-12T13:21:38Z",
      "body": "Hi,\r\nmy address filed is not require both in mailchimp and and in the plugin... but it doesn't work \r\n\r\nA solution could be replacing \r\n`<option data-country=\"US\" value=\"\">---</option>\r\n`\r\nwith\r\n`<option data-country=\"US\" value=\"-\">---</option>\r\n`\r\nin https://github.com/yikesinc/yikes-inc-easy-mailchimp-extender/blob/master/public/partials/shortcodes/templates/state-and-province-dropdown.php\r\n\r\nWould you accept a PR?",
