      "created_at": "2017-12-12T13:24:54Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-12-12T13:24:54Z",
      "body": "The problem is that we need an empty value for folks who want to force users to select a state. \r\n\r\nWe do filter that list of states though so you could use a filter function to change the list. I'm afraid this wouldn't be any different from your current work-around though.\r\n\r\nI was almost certain we had a solution for this so let me do some research.",
